USER of that can be read by someone outside Plumbline: it is Plumbline's own shape, checked against a corpus a stranger
USER does not have. custody/v1 (evaluatordriven/custody, SPEC.md section 4) is the public shape for the same facts —
USER who set the bar and when, who approved that exact bar, who made the work, who read it, beside which controls, and
USER what the approver decided. This emitter writes that record from the job's own files, so a stranger with only the
